# name: test/wasm/negative_control.wasmtest
# description: v0.9.0 Phase 8 live-CI negative control (CI-01). A DELIBERATELY WRONG
#   expected value, so the curated DuckDB-Wasm harness must exit 1 and the
#   wasm-runtime-test gate must turn RED. Uses a .wasmtest extension so the native
#   `unittest "test/*"` run (which collects every *.test under test/) never sees it. Reverted right after observation.
# group: [wasm]

require anofox_forecast

query I
SELECT 1 + 1;
----
3
